'''Yellow dye''' is one of the sixteen available [[dye]]s.

== Obtaining ==

=== Crafting ===
{{Crafting
  |head=1
  |Dandelion;Wildflowers;Golden Dandelion
  |Output=Yellow Dye
  |type=Material
}}
{{Crafting
  |Sunflower
  |Output=Yellow Dye,2
  |type=Material
  |foot=1
}}

=== Generated loot ===
{{LootChestItem|yellow-dye}}

=== Trading ===
[[Wandering trader]]s may sell 3 yellow dye for an [[emerald]].
{{Trade sources}}

=== Mob loot ===
{{IN|bedrock}}, [[wandering traders]] have a chance of 8.5% (increased by 1% per level of [[Looting]]) to drop 3 yellow dyes when killed while showing the item as trade offer, if the player holds an [[emerald]].

